            "heading": "<strong>The Pacific Essences® Story</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_FbDnxV": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Pacific Essences® was born in the early 1980s on Vancouver Island. We are the first company dedicated to exploring the therapeutic values of the<strong> vibrational energy of indigenous flowers and plants of the Pacific Northwest. </strong></p><p>Our <a href=\"/collections/sea-essences\" title=\"Sea Essences\"><strong>Sea Essences</strong></a> - made from plants and creatures of the Pacific Ocean - were a first in the vibrational pharmacopia, and have proven to be a <strong>valuable new frequency</strong> in the repertory of vibrational medicine. </p><p>We’ve stayed true to our core beliefs and commitment to offer exceptional Essences for the benefit of our community: patrons, students, ambassadors, distributors and friends alike. We owe a huge thanks to our community for joining us on this awesome journey, and <strong>we hope that you will continue to be part of our story.</strong></p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
        "button_X3rRqU": {
